# Product scope guardrails

## In scope for MVP
- Payment difficulty / arrears call scenario only (PD1–PD8)
- Guided workflow from intake to wrap-up
- Support and escalation surfacing
- Case note and coaching generation
- Synthetic Acme City Council demo data

## Out of scope — do not build
- Live telephony or audio processing
- Real council tax system of record integration
- Full Council Tax Reduction decisioning
- Automated payment arrangement calculation engine
- Full debt recovery processing
- Resident self-service portal
- Enterprise SSO or identity provider
- Multi-authority configuration
